---
const manufacturingContact = 'mailto:hello@fulcrumagentics.com?subject=Hardware%20R%26D%20Feasibility%20Inquiry';
---

<section id="services" class="section services-dual">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading-left">
      <p class="eyebrow">Two service lines. One engineering mindset.</p>
      <h2>Automate the business. Engineer the product.</h2>
      <p>Fulcrum Agentics connects dependable AI operations with a developing Arizona-based product R&amp;D and micro-manufacturing practice. We work with outside companies as well as affiliated ventures, with human review and defined technical milestones.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-dual-grid">
      <article class="dual-service-card">
        <div class="dual-copy">
          <span class="dual-kicker">01 / Established service</span>
          <h3>AI workflows &amp; agentic operations</h3>
          <p>Connect messy data, systems, and repeatable decisions into reviewable workflows. Start with one measurable operating loop—not an uncontrolled automation.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Supplier and catalog intelligence</li>
            <li>Orders, fulfillment, and approvals</li>
            <li>Business software integrations and audit trails</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="dual-proof"><strong>Reference client:</strong> Hotels4Humanity (affiliated business).</p>
          <a href="#ai-office" class="dual-link">Explore AI services <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <img class="dual-image" src="/assets/proof/route-authority-results.png" alt="Actual Route Authority workflow screenshot showing controlled AI review outputs" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </article>
      <article class="dual-service-card dual-hardware">
        <div class="dual-copy">
          <span class="dual-kicker">02 / Capability under development</span>
          <h3>Product R&amp;D &amp; pilot manufacturing</h3>
          <p>Prototype and prepare small-batch electronic products using additive manufacturing, PCB assembly, CNC tooling, and injection molding—subject to feasibility and equipment readiness.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>3D-printed prototypes and fixtures</li>
            <li>PCB placement and board-assembly planning</li>
            <li>Tooling, molded enclosures, and pilot runs</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="dual-proof"><strong>Development reference:</strong> BacRub LLC (affiliated hardware customer).</p>
          <a href="/manufacturing/" class="dual-link">Explore hardware R&amp;D <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <figure class="dual-media">
          <img class="dual-image" src="https://www.opulo.io/cdn/shop/files/v4-ortho-hero.png?height=4000&amp;v=1724515103" alt="Real Opulo LumenPnP desktop PCB component placement machine; manufacturer reference photograph" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" />
          <figcaption>Equipment reference: Opulo LumenPnP. Not a photo of Fulcrum's facility. <a href="https://www.opulo.io/products/lumenpnp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source ↗</a></figcaption>
        </figure>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="dual-footnote">
      <strong>Have an outside project?</strong>
      <span>We can scope either an AI workflow or a product feasibility study. Hardware production availability is not yet represented as operational.</span>
      <a href={manufacturingContact}>Discuss feasibility →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-dual { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); background: var(--color-bg); }
  .services-dual-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
  .dual-service-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); }
  .dual-copy { padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px); flex: 1; }
  .dual-kicker { color: var(--color-brand-amber); font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .dual-copy h3 { color: var(--color-text); font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 2.6vw, 2rem); margin: 14px 0; line-height: 1.16; }
  .dual-copy p, .dual-copy li { color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }
  .dual-copy ul { margin: 18px 0; padding-left: 22px; }
  .dual-copy li { margin: 7px 0; }
  .dual-copy .dual-proof { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding-top: 16px; font-size: .88rem; }
  .dual-proof strong { color: var(--color-text); }
  .dual-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 6px; font-weight: 780; color: var(--color-brand-slate); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 5px; }
  :global(html.theme-dark) .dual-link { color: var(--color-brand-amber); }
  .dual-image { display: block; width: 100%; height: 245px; object-fit: contain; background: #f2f4f6; padding: 12px; }
  .dual-media { margin: 0; }
  .dual-media figcaption { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: .72rem; line-height: 1.5; padding: 10px 15px; background: var(--color-surface-2); }
  .dual-media figcaption a { text-decoration: underline; }
  .dual-footnote { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); margin-top: 26px; padding-top: 20px; }
  .dual-footnote strong { flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--color-text); }
  .dual-footnote span { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .dual-footnote a { white-space: nowrap; color: var(--color-text); font-weight: 800; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 5px; }
  @media (max-width: 850px) { .services-dual-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .dual-footnote { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; } }
</style>
